    "updated_at": "2026-04-02T15:21:16Z",
    "body": "@hzh0425 Are you sure? \\\nBecause on both v0.5.9 and v0.5.10rc0 it fails with:\n```\nFile \"/sgl-workspace/sglang/python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/hiradix_cache.py\", line 97, in __init__\n    raise ValueError(f\"HiRadixCache only supports MHA and MLA yet\")\n\nValueError: HiRadixCache only supports MHA and MLA yet\n```\n\nCommand:\n```\nMOONCAKE_TE_META_DATA_SERVER=\"http://localhost:8080/metadata\" \\\nMOONCAKE_MASTER=\"localhost:50051\" \\\nMOONCAKE_PROTOCOL=\"rdma\" \\\nMOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE=\"32gb\" \\\npython -m sglang.launch_server \\\n    --enable-hierarchical-cache \\\n    --hicache-storage-prefetch-policy timeout \\\n    --hicache-storage-backend mooncake \\\n    --hicache-mem-layout page_first \\\n    --hicache-write-policy write_through \\\n    --model /models/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-FP8 \\\n    --prefill-attention-backend fa3 \\\n    --decode-attention-backend fa3 \\\n    --tp 2 \\\n    --host 0.0.0.0 \\\n    --mamba-scheduler-strategy extra_buffer \\\n    --port 8000 \\\n    --page-size 64 \\\n    --max-total-tokens 656256 \\\n    --kv-cache-dtype fp8_e4m3 \\\n    --tool-call-parser qwen3_coder \\\n    --log-level-http warning \\\n    --enable-metrics \\\n    --enable-cache-report\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
